{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo-developed with love and obsession.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>About the Demo</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a polished final product \u2014 it\u2019s the foundation of something bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo released for Steam Next Fest represents an early glimpse of what <i>Ryne-Arca</i> will grow into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than focusing on balance or systems, we invite you to experience the atmosphere and imagine the potential that lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>About the Game</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young girl, longing to escape the real world, finds herself lost within the depths of her own mind. This is her story\u2014a quiet journey through an inner landscape shaped by emotion, memory, and mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/extras/8b8e7e5144c7bf483a2a24501e5563d9.avif?t=1774330141\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast semi-open world at your own pace. From the very beginning, you're free to seek out the ending\u2014or simply wander.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly every monster drops unique equipment, encouraging experimentation and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger through companion-based combat, light crafting mechanics, and flexible character development.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/extras/2c1cefadfd2847fe98aade7c10c83ead.avif?t=1774330141\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/extras_big/2c1cefadfd2847fe98aade7c10c83ead.avif?t=1774330141 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats are upgraded individually, allowing for personalized builds rather than traditional level-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/extras/7c144703f8db23409921bab3bd9eb527.avif?t=1774330141\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Notes</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is currently in development. <br>All screenshots and visuals reflect a work-in-progress and may change over time. <br>I\u2019ll continue updating the store page as development progresses. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720440?t=1774330141","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/55d6a1182b186a4570f4d40af33c01b055dc83d7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774330141","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/ea3a65557bfabbe123d63604e84427c652cfa41d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774330141","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/ea3a65557bfabbe123d63604e84427c652cfa41d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774330141","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4051380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo-developed with love and obsession.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>About the Demo</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a polished final product \u2014 it\u2019s the foundation of something bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo released for Steam Next Fest represents an early glimpse of what <i>Ryne-Arca</i> will grow into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than focusing on balance or systems, we invite you to experience the atmosphere and imagine the potential that lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>About the Game</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young girl, longing to escape the real world, finds herself lost within the depths of her own mind. This is her story\u2014a quiet journey through an inner landscape shaped by emotion, memory, and mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/extras/8b8e7e5144c7bf483a2a24501e5563d9.avif?t=1774330141\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast semi-open world at your own pace. From the very beginning, you're free to seek out the ending\u2014or simply wander.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly every monster drops unique equipment, encouraging experimentation and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger through companion-based combat, light crafting mechanics, and flexible character development.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/extras/2c1cefadfd2847fe98aade7c10c83ead.avif?t=1774330141\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/extras_big/2c1cefadfd2847fe98aade7c10c83ead.avif?t=1774330141 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats are upgraded individually, allowing for personalized builds rather than traditional level-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/extras/7c144703f8db23409921bab3bd9eb527.avif?t=1774330141\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Notes</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is currently in development. <br>All screenshots and visuals reflect a work-in-progress and may change over time. <br>I\u2019ll continue updating the store page as development progresses. </p>","developers":["Asuka Watanabe"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720440/79a154192fc582a4108c83280d2941052100edd5/header.jpg?t=1774330141","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3720440/55158450/cea7ea7939ceee316e375b5ebbf816d273fe5f0f/1763879556/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763879992","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3720440/55158450/cea7ea7939ceee316e375b5ebbf816d273fe5f0f/1763879556/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763879992","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3720440/55158450/cea7ea7939ceee316e375b5ebbf816d273fe5f0f/1763879556/hls_264_mas